# Big Bass Signs live site

Repo: `BigBassSigns/bigbasssigns-site` on `main`. Cloudflare Worker `muddy-wind-ead0` deploys from main. Domain: bigbasssigns.com.

Edit this static site in place. Do not create a second site or a navy/orange theme.

## Design

- Charcoal header `#1c1c1c`, gold buttons `#c4a046`, white pages, system fonts
- Match `css/styles.css` (mobile-first)
- Nav: Menu checkbox + `<details>` dropdowns (Construction / Business / Vehicles / About + Contact + phone)

## IA (customer type)

- Construction: land use, SWPPP, safety, boards/install, grants, `/Construction-Stages`
- Business: banners, storefront, directional
- Vehicles: wraps, stickers, `/boat-letters`, `/specials/truck-logo-packages`
- About: shop, `/home/equipment`, `/service-area`
- Contact: `/contact`

Keep old Google Sites URLs for Ads: `/Sign-Details/*`, `/Construction-Stages/*`, `/service-area/*`, `/home/equipment`. Do not delete old paths; add a 301 in `_redirects` if a URL moves.

Priority SEO city pages only: Lynnwood, Everett, Redmond, Sammamish, Woodinville. Other cities stay under `/service-area`.

## Photos

JPGs/PNGs live in `photos/` with stable names. HTML uses `/photos/...` — never `drive.google.com/thumbnail`. Compress PNGs over ~1.5MB. Source Drive folder + `IMAGE-INDEX.csv` when asked to import photos. Do not invent jobs, clients, or photos.

## Content

Use existing copy (regulated signage, print/install/remove, jurisdiction specs). Keyword-aware but short.

## Deploy

Commit/push to `main` only when asked. Worker deploys from main.
